<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Federal-Mogul raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Federal-Mogul raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Darren Kimball upgraded Federal-Mogul Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;stock's long-running underperformance creates a catalyst for sweeping change within the company,&quot; Kimball said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- sees possibility company will seek to sell &quot;crown jewels&quot; of manufacturing operations.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 7/8 to 17-5/8.</p>
</text>
